#
# docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md item 15's tag probe: `[*]` then a filter asking which tags carry a `Type` key, `!empty`
# requiring that one does. Over list-shaped tags the filter selects the elements carrying the key; a tag
# list of Key/Value pairs holds none, so the selection is empty and the clause fails.
#
rule r { Resources.*.Properties.Tags[*][ Type exists ] !empty }
